{
    "title": "Texaco",
    "description": "Welcome to the NEW Texaco app! We\u2019ve combined with the ExtraMile Rewards program to bring you an enhanced fueling and convenience-store experience at participating locations with new benefits and greater convenience. Must be 16 years or older to join.\r\n\r\nChevron, Texaco, and ExtraMile Rewards apps all have the same features and functions, all accessing the same points and rewards balances. We\u2019ve refreshed the home screen design and added an offers filter, so that you can see the offers and discounts you want to see.\r\n\r\nEarn points for rewards on Chevron- and Texaco-branded fuel, enjoy mobile pay, get exclusive ExtraMile offers, and track ExtraMile Club Program card punches. PLUS, receive an EXTRA special Welcome Rewards offer!\r\n\r\nHow to save on gas or diesel with the Texaco app:\r\n\u2022 Sign up and join the Chevron Texaco Rewards program via the app.\r\n\u2022 Earn points on fuel and qualifying in-store purchases. Redeem rewards for up to 50\u00a2 off per gallon at participating locations.\r\n\r\nHow to Fuel Up via the Texaco app:\r\n\u2022 Before heading to the location, link an accepted payment method to your User Account.\r\n\u2022 At the location, use the app to reserve your pump and select the payment method from your driver\u2019s seat.\r\n\u2022 When prompted, fill up at the pump and go. Your receipt will be waiting for you in the app!\r\n\r\nEasy ways to stay connected:\r\n\u2022 Connect your phone to the car\u2019s dashboard and open the app to find locations, redeem rewards, add a car wash, and pay for fuel. This feature is available for Android Auto users.\r\n\u2022 Use your Wear OS device to fuel up and redeem your rewards points at participating Texaco stations that accept mobile payments.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional features to help keep you going:\r\n\u2022 View your available rewards and program details in the new \u201cMy Rewards\u201d screen \r\n\u2022 Find lower carbon intensity products like renewable diesel blends and compressed natural gas.\r\n\u2022 Filter through amenities such as Convenience Store, Restrooms, Full-Service Car Wash, Amazon Pickup, EV Charging, and more.\r\n\u2022 View in-app receipts for mobile payments.\r\n\u2022 Get answers to frequently asked questions anytime and anywhere in the app with our Mobi digital chatbot.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the NEW Texaco app! We\u2019ve combined with the ExtraMile Rewards program to bring you an enhanced fueling and convenience-store experience at participating locations with new benefits and greater convenience. Must be 16 years or older to join.<br><br>Chevron, Texaco, and ExtraMile Rewards apps all have the same features and functions, all accessing the same points and rewards balances. We\u2019ve refreshed the home screen design and added an offers filter, so that you can see the offers and discounts you want to see.<br><br>Earn points for rewards on Chevron- and Texaco-branded fuel, enjoy mobile pay, get exclusive ExtraMile offers, and track ExtraMile Club Program card punches. PLUS, receive an EXTRA special Welcome Rewards offer!<br><br>How to save on gas or diesel with the Texaco app:<br>\u2022 Sign up and join the Chevron Texaco Rewards program via the app.<br>\u2022 Earn points on fuel and qualifying in-store purchases. Redeem rewards for up to 50\u00a2 off per gallon at participating locations.<br><br>How to Fuel Up via the Texaco app:<br>\u2022 Before heading to the location, link an accepted payment method to your User Account.<br>\u2022 At the location, use the app to reserve your pump and select the payment method from your driver\u2019s seat.<br>\u2022 When prompted, fill up at the pump and go. Your receipt will be waiting for you in the app!<br><br>Easy ways to stay connected:<br>\u2022 Connect your phone to the car\u2019s dashboard and open the app to find locations, redeem rewards, add a car wash, and pay for fuel. This feature is available for Android Auto users.<br>\u2022 Use your Wear OS device to fuel up and redeem your rewards points at participating Texaco stations that accept mobile payments.<br><br><br>Additional features to help keep you going:<br>\u2022 View your available rewards and program details in the new \u201cMy Rewards\u201d screen <br>\u2022 Find lower carbon intensity products like renewable diesel blends and compressed natural gas.<br>\u2022 Filter through amenities such as Convenience Store, Restrooms, Full-Service Car Wash, Amazon Pickup, EV Charging, and more.<br>\u2022 View in-app receipts for mobile payments.<br>\u2022 Get answers to frequently asked questions anytime and anywhere in the app with our Mobi digital chatbot.",
